\newlabel{fig:buffer-table-contour}{{7}{14}{\textbf {Bastankhah.} Required buffer $d^*(a, f)$ at $\tau = 0.2\%$ AEP ($K = 2000$, FunWake schedule). Markers: fitted real-site placements (Horns Rev 1, Lillgrund, Borssele, Princess Amalia, DEI). The five fitted real-site placements require $d^* \approx 8$--$9D$ ($\sim $2\,km) at this threshold}{figure.caption.9}{}}
